"🧢 1 boot spec — none declare a budget
   ├─ 559 tokens (no budget)  .agent/repo=test/role=surfer/boot.yml (linked)  [~] modded · 1 shadow · 1 add · 1 not
   │
   └─ swept
      ├─ .agent/repo=*/role=*/boot.yml
      ├─ .behavior/*/boot.yml
      ├─ .route/*/boot.yml
      └─ src/domain.roles/*/boot.yml

   .note = a spec outside these paths is not swept. name it directly to cost it —
           \`roles cost --what <path>\`.

   .note = a \`(linked)\` spec is owned by another repo — not yours to trim. its budget is
           that repo's to raise, so \`roles boot\` warns on it rather than halts. upgrade
           the package, or raise it upstream. (1 of 1 here)
   .note = a \`(linked)\` spec marked \`[~] modded\` carries your mod's shadows and adds,
           and those are yours to trim in .agent/repo=.mods/. a shadow with no \`.md.min\`
           beside it boots at full size. (1 of 1 linked here)

"
`;

